				Time="2011-05-23T02:44:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d08r0901_dstone_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まわりの　オーラを　とりこんだ
ダークストーンが▽
それを　きょうれつな　パワーとし▼
いま……▼
ときはなつ……！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:38:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:38:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>周囲の　オーラを　取りこんだ
ダークストーンが▽
それを　強烈な　パワーに　変換し▼
いま……▼
解き放つ……！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:38:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:38:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>システム：Black2ver
・はい選択時
・まずストーン浮上デモ
・ゼクロム復活デモ
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-19T07:30:54" />
		</CommentCell>
